          "docs": "This endpoint will only update the fields that are present in the request.\n\nYou must specify \"id\", \"startDate\" and/or \"endDate\" of the phases for this endpoint.\n\n            \nIf the <strong>\"shiftDates\"</strong> property is true and you specify a changed phase start or end date in this request,\nthen the phase's start and end dates will be adjusted by the same amount.\nIf this property is set to true, then you must only send EITHER startDate OR endDate - only startDate is considered when both date"
